 245:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *                        More banks uses more USB DPRAM, but offers better performance. Isochro
 246:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Endpoint_AVR8.h **** 			 *                        endpoints <b>must</b> have at least two banks.
