 127:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 			/** Sends a Remote Wakeup request to the host. This signals to the host that the device should
 128:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 			 *  be taken out of suspended mode, and communications should resume.
