 135:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 			 *        issued if the host is currently allowing remote wakeup events from the device (i.e.,
 136:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 			 *        the \ref USB_Device_RemoteWakeupEnabled flag is set). When the \c NO_DEVICE_REMOTE_WAK
 137:../lufa-LUFA-111009/LUFA/Drivers/USB/Core/AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/../AVR8/Device_AVR8.h **** 			 *        compile time option is used, this macro is unavailable.
